00:00:00.00>ARR001 ATDIST 16.048900,108.198700,0.02 PCALL _KB5_ARR001_HOLD_G4
# Trigger: khi càng ARR001 chạm đất → sau 30s DEP001 chạy đà + DEP002 vào 35R
00:00:00.00>ARR001 ATALT 0 DELAY 30.0 PCALL _KB5_DEP001_ROLL

